/// \defgroup grp_save_load_crc Save and load, CRC and replay
/// \brief Snapshot and Xfer serialisation, save files, checksums and replays.
///
/// The `Snapshot` base and the `Xfer` visitor that saves, loads and
/// checksums it; `GameState` and `GameStateMap` for save files;
/// `GameLogic::getCRC` for the multiplayer checksum; `RecorderClass` for
/// replays. \ref sub_save_load_crc describes the subsystem, its state and
/// its differences from Zero Hour.
